      "title": "संवाद — At the vegetable market",
      "intro": "Ani is shopping at the market near her home. Notice two things: the question word कितना changing shape, and how Ani bargains without sounding rude — in India bargaining is a conversation, not a fight.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "आनी:",
          "text": "[भैया|bhai-yaa], [ये|ye] [टमाटर|Ta-maa-Tar] [कितने|kit-ne] [के|ke] [हैं|haiⁿ]?",
