          "id": "Forty rupees a kilo, madam.",
          "literal": "forty — rupees — kilo, madam."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "आनी:",
          "text": "[चालीस|chaa-liis]? [बहुत|ba-hut] [महँगे|ma-haⁿ-ge] [हैं|haiⁿ]। [तीस|tiis] [कर|kar] [लीजिए|lii-ji-ye]।",
          "id": "Forty? That's very expensive. Make it thirty.",
