          "after": [
            "⚠️ **उन्नीस (19), उनतीस (29), उनतालीस (39), उनचास (49)** all start with उन-, meaning \"one less\": literally \"one short of twenty\". This little pattern holds up to उनहत्तर (69) and helps a lot.",
