  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Saying how many, and everyday shopping items",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The number goes in front of the noun, and the noun goes into the plural: *दो किताबें*, *तीन कमरे*, *पाँच लोग*. The one trap: a noun after a unit such as kilo or rupee does not go plural — *दो किलो चावल*, not *दो किलो चावलें*."
